---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Software & Tools">
  <p class="eyebrow">Manik Bansal</p>
  <h1>Software & Tools</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Scientific programming and simulation tools used across computational
    mechanics research.
  </p>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Scientific computing</h2>
      <p>MATLAB, Python, Tcl, and shell scripting.</p>
      <p>Linux HPC clusters, SLURM scripting, and PSC Bridges-2.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Modeling & analysis</h2>
      <p>LS-DYNA, Abaqus, ANSYS, and FEBio.</p>
      <p>
        XFEM, multiscale modeling, explicit/implicit dynamics, and
        fracture/damage modeling.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Imaging & visualization</h2>
      <p>
        3D Slicer, Avizo, ImageJ, HyperMesh, CUBIT, MATLAB GIBBON, ParaView, and
        HyperView.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <h2>Research software</h2>
